    "name": "Group 1 LoRaWAN Info",
    "info": "## Group 1 - LoRaWAN Device Info\n\n**Application ID:** `53ee255f-1620-4450-9f51-eba79ca3e920`\n**MQTT Topic:** `application/53ee255f-1620-4450-9f51-eba79ca3e920/device/+/event/up`\n**Telegram Chat ID:** `-5169976956`\n**All-groups Chat ID:** `-5144508977`\n\n### Relay 1 (4 Channel Relay)\n- **DEV EUI:** `48E663FFFE301037`\n- **APP EUI:** `48FF00000001037`\n- **APP KEY:** `2DE5BF9094E3D2587DA01A4F073D59BC`\n\n### TempHum1 (Temp & Humid Sensor)\n- **DEV EUI:** `48E663FFFE3010EB`\n- **APP EUI:** `48FF0000000010EB`\n- **APP KEY:** `653B3A3BAFFBE9105E520476152DA813`\n\n---\n**Telegram for Windows:** [Download](https://telegram.org/dl/desktop/win)\n\n**AgroSense Sensor Manual:** [PDF](https://github.com/Makerfabs/Agrosense-Decoder/blob/main/Agrosense_Air_Temperature_Humidity_Sensor/AgroSense_Air%20Temperature%20and%20Humidity%20Sensor%20LoRaWAN%C2%AE%20Manual%20V1.2.pdf)\n\n**Telegram Web App:** [Open](https://web.telegram.org/k/)\n**Node-RED Telegram Docs:** [flows.nodered.org](https://flows.nodered.org/node/node-red-contrib-telegrambot)\n",
